24. en# {d}nin-ŋiš-zid#-da [za₃-mi₂]-zu dug₃-[ga-am₃]
#tr.en: Lord @wDN{Ninŋišzida}, your praise is sweet.
#lem: en[lord]; Ninŋešzidak[1]; zamin[praise]; dug[good]
#etcsl: line-id=24

@div trailer 

25. bal-bal-e {[d]}[nin-ŋiš-zid]-da#-ka
#tr.en: A @fsux{balbale} of @wDN{Ninŋišzida}.
